"#/wiki/Albinius\">Albinius</a> to assemble the rune parts together.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/forgotten-knowledge-quest\">Forgotten Knowledge Quest</a></li><li>Inert Astral Shaper Rune</li><li>Light Sources</li><li>Part of a Rune</li><li>Part of a Rune (Five)</li><li>Part of a Rune (Four)</li><li>Part of a Rune (One)</li><li>Part of a Rune (Six)</li><li>Part of a Rune (Three)</li><li>Part of a Rune (Two)</li><li>Rhino Rider</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Rhino\">Stone Rhino</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Rhino%20%28Mount%29\">Stone Rhino (Mount)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["forgotten-knowledge-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"forgotten-knowledge-quest","quest":"Forgotten Knowledge Quest","step":"0-3","n":4,"title":"Os seis portais","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}